# Fase 4 — Sport Science & E-Proposal Pembinaan

Rekam fisik atlet Puslatcab, grafik perkembangan, dan sistem e-proposal digital.

---

## Task Checklist

### 4.1 Rekam Data Fisik Atlet (Sport Science)
- [ ] Prisma model: `PhysicalTest` (vo2Max, strength, endurance, flexibility, speed)
- [ ] Endpoint: `POST /api/v1/athletes/:id/physical-tests` [COACH+]
- [ ] Endpoint: `GET /api/v1/athletes/:id/physical-tests` — riwayat tes
- [ ] Input tes fisik oleh pelatih: VO2Max, kekuatan, daya tahan, fleksibilitas, sprint
- [ ] Validasi range nilai (misal VO2Max 20-90 ml/kg/min)
- [ ] Catatan program latihan per sesi tes

### 4.2 Grafik & Analisis Perkembangan
- [ ] Chart library: Recharts atau Chart.js
- [ ] Grafik tren per metrik fisik dari waktu ke waktu (line chart)
- [ ] Perbandingan data antar atlet dalam satu cabor (bar chart)
- [ ] Summary card: peningkatan/penurunan vs tes sebelumnya
- [ ] Filter by periode waktu (3 bulan, 6 bulan, 1 tahun)

### 4.3 Dashboard Sport Science
- [ ] Halaman overview semua atlet Puslatcab
- [ ] Ranking atlet per metrik fisik dalam cabor
- [ ] Alert: atlet yang menunjukkan penurunan performa
- [ ] Rekomendasi program latihan berbasis data

### 4.4 E-Proposal Pembinaan
- [ ] Prisma model: `Proposal`, `ProposalItem`, `ProposalComment`
- [ ] Workflow status: `DRAFT` → `SUBMITTED` → `REVIEW` → `APPROVED` / `REJECTED`
- [ ] Endpoint: `POST /api/v1/proposals` — ajukan proposal [CABOR_ADMIN]
- [ ] Endpoint: `PATCH /api/v1/proposals/:id/status` — approve/reject [SUPER_ADMIN]
- [ ] Endpoint: `GET /api/v1/proposals` — list proposal (filter: status, cabor)
- [ ] Tipe proposal: Dana Pembinaan, Peralatan, Fasilitas, Lainnya
- [ ] Upload lampiran dokumen pendukung (RAB, surat pengajuan)
- [ ] Komentar/catatan per proposal (thread discussion)

### 4.5 Notifikasi Proposal
- [ ] Email notifikasi ke Super Admin saat proposal diajukan
- [ ] Email notifikasi ke Admin Cabor saat proposal disetujui/ditolak
- [ ] In-app notification badge di dashboard

### 4.6 Frontend Pages
- [ ] Halaman input tes fisik (`/admin/sport-science/input`)
- [ ] Dashboard grafik atlet (`/admin/sport-science/:athleteId`)
- [ ] Perbandingan atlet (`/admin/sport-science/compare`)
- [ ] Form ajukan proposal (`/admin/proposals/new`)
- [ ] Daftar proposal + status tracking (`/admin/proposals`)
- [ ] Detail proposal + komentar (`/admin/proposals/:id`)
- [ ] Review & approve proposal (`/admin/proposals/:id/review`) [SUPER_ADMIN]

### 4.7 Verifikasi
- [ ] Input tes fisik → data tersimpan → grafik terupdate
- [ ] Perbandingan 2+ atlet → chart menampilkan data yang benar
- [ ] Submit proposal → email ke Super Admin → approve → email ke Admin Cabor
- [ ] Tracking status proposal → semua transisi status berfungsi
- [ ] Arsip histori proposal lengkap dan bisa di-filter

