## Implementation Plan

### Database Models

#### [MODIFY] `prisma/schema.prisma`

Tambah model baru:

```prisma
model PhysicalTest {
  id          String   @id @default(cuid())
  athleteId   String
  athlete     Athlete  @relation(fields: [athleteId], references: [id])
  testDate    DateTime
  vo2Max      Float?   // ml/kg/min
  strength    Float?   // kg
  endurance   Float?   // detik (Cooper test)
  flexibility Float?   // cm (sit and reach)
  speed       Float?   // detik (sprint 30m)
  notes       String?
  recordedBy  String   // coach user ID
  createdAt   DateTime @default(now())
}

model Proposal {
  id          String         @id @default(cuid())
  caborId     String
  cabor       CabangOlahraga @relation(fields: [caborId], references: [id])
  submittedBy String
  title       String
  type        ProposalType   // DANA_PEMBINAAN | PERALATAN | FASILITAS | LAINNYA
  description String
  totalAmount Float?         // total anggaran yang diajukan
  status      ProposalStatus @default(DRAFT)  // DRAFT | SUBMITTED | REVIEW | APPROVED | REJECTED
  items       ProposalItem[]
  comments    ProposalComment[]
  attachments ProposalAttachment[]
  submittedAt DateTime?
  reviewedAt  DateTime?
  reviewedBy  String?
  reviewNote  String?
  createdAt   DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt   DateTime @updatedAt
}

model ProposalItem {
  id          String   @id @default(cuid())
  proposalId  String
  proposal    Proposal @relation(fields: [proposalId], references: [id])
  name        String   // "Sepatu Lari Nike Vaporfly"
  quantity    Int
  unitPrice   Float
  subtotal    Float
}

model ProposalComment {
  id         String   @id @default(cuid())
  proposalId String
  proposal   Proposal @relation(fields: [proposalId], references: [id])
  userId     String
  content    String
  createdAt  DateTime @default(now())
}
```

---

### API Routes

#### [NEW] `apps/api/src/routes/physical-tests.ts`

```
POST /api/v1/athletes/:id/physical-tests  → input tes fisik [COACH+]
GET  /api/v1/athletes/:id/physical-tests  → riwayat tes [ATHLETE+]
GET  /api/v1/sport-science/compare        → perbandingan atlet [COACH+]
GET  /api/v1/sport-science/rankings       → ranking per cabor [COACH+]
```

#### [NEW] `apps/api/src/routes/proposals.ts`

```
GET    /api/v1/proposals              → list (filter: status, cabor) [CABOR_ADMIN+]
POST   /api/v1/proposals              → buat proposal baru [CABOR_ADMIN]
GET    /api/v1/proposals/:id          → detail + items + comments [CABOR_ADMIN+]
PATCH  /api/v1/proposals/:id          → edit draft [CABOR_ADMIN]
PATCH  /api/v1/proposals/:id/submit   → submit untuk review [CABOR_ADMIN]
PATCH  /api/v1/proposals/:id/review   → approve/reject [SUPER_ADMIN]
POST   /api/v1/proposals/:id/comments → tambah komentar [CABOR_ADMIN+]
POST   /api/v1/proposals/:id/attachments → upload lampiran [CABOR_ADMIN]
```

