## Verification Plan

| Test | Cara Verifikasi |
|------|----------------|
| Physical Test | Coach input VO2Max, strength → data muncul di grafik atlet |
| Trend Chart | Input 3+ tes pada waktu berbeda → line chart menunjukkan tren |
| Compare | Pilih 2 atlet → bar chart menampilkan perbandingan akurat |
| Proposal Create | Admin Cabor buat proposal + items → status DRAFT |
| Proposal Submit | Submit → status SUBMITTED → email ke Super Admin |
| Proposal Review | Super Admin approve → status APPROVED → email ke Admin Cabor |
| Comment Thread | Tambah komentar → muncul di detail proposal |
